Detourmap Places dataset
https://detourmap.com/data/

To the extent possible under law, Detourmap (detourmap.com) has dedicated
this compilation to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0
Universal Public Domain Dedication. The underlying facts come from Wikidata,
which is itself published under CC0.

You can copy, modify, distribute and use the data, even for commercial
purposes, all without asking permission. Attribution is appreciated but not
required — a link to https://detourmap.com is the nice move.

Full dedication text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

Note: the `image` column contains URLs to files hosted on Wikimedia Commons.
The photographs themselves are NOT part of this dataset and each carries its
own per-file license on Commons — check a file's Commons page before
republishing the image itself.
